* kicad-cli 10.0.6 `sch export netlist --format spice` (econ-core, 2026-10-30) of the kicad-demos 9.0.2 fixture; .include paths made relative. Reference deck for kxc-3.
.title KiCad schematic
.include "ad8051.lib"
.control
version
.endc
.ac dec 10 1 1Meg

C2 Net-_U1-+_ GND 100n
XU1 Net-_U1-+_ /lowpass VDD VSS /lowpass AD8051
R1 Net-_C1-Pad2_ Net-_R1-Pad2_ 1k
V1 Net-_R1-Pad2_ GND DC ac=1 AC 1  
R2 Net-_U1-+_ Net-_C1-Pad2_ 1k
C1 /lowpass Net-_C1-Pad2_ 100n
V2 VDD GND DC 10 
V3 GND VSS DC 10 
.end
